type: software
title: "A hybrid stochastic multi-objective framework for urban emergency pharmaceutical routing: source code, synthetic data and results (S-MOVRPTW)"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-12"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.20714222"
